.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WEBHOOK ROTATE"
.SH NAME
hamstik webhook rotate \- Rotate a webhook signing secret; the new secret is returned once
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik webhook rotate [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Rotate a webhook signing secret; the new secret is returned once
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I WEBHOOK_ID
Webhook endpoint id
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Idempotency key override
